config BR2_PACKAGE_THINGINO_UVCD
	bool "thingino-uvcd"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_THINGINO_RAPTOR_HAL
	select BR2_PACKAGE_THINGINO_KOPT_GADGET_WEBCAM
	select BR2_PACKAGE_THINGINO_SYSTEM_USB_ROLE
	help
	  Minimal fixed-function UVC webcam daemon for T31 + GC2083.

	  Fuses ISP/encoder bring-up and the UVC gadget bridge into one
	  process. Standard image controls are exposed on the UVC
	  Processing Unit; nonstandard ISP controls on Extension Unit 4.

	  Enabled directly by the camera defconfig rather than through
	  the thingino streamer choice. Requires the uvcd gadget
	  descriptors in the kernel's g_webcam.
